    <string name="guide_points_title">How to estimate points?</string>
    <string name="guide_points_intro">Relative size (never hours): volume × complexity × uncertainty (“do I know how to do it?”). Compare with your own finished tasks: “bigger than this one, smaller than that one”. A few seconds; when in doubt, round up.</string>
    <string name="guide_points_outro">Different from the duration: points feed the order (effort divides the score), the duration is used to place the task in the day. A task can be short but tricky, or long but mechanical.</string>
    <string name="guide_points_yours">for you ≈ %1$s (median of %2$d task(s))</string>
    <string name="guide_points_yours_unreliable">for you ≈ %1$s (median of %2$d task(s), not reliable)</string>
